OL,3,ASimon Jack: Can Anthropic's            
OL,4,Arecord-breaking IPO stop the AI bubble 
OL,5,Abursting?                              
OL,7,FSimon Jack: Can Anthropic's            
OL,8,Frecord-breaking IPO stop the AI bubble 
OL,9,Fbursting?                              
OL,11,FIt was during November 2020 that       
OL,12,Fsomewhere in San Francisco, a woman    
OL,13,Fcalled Daniela Amodei phoned a friend, 
OL,14,Fasking for advice.                     
OL,16,FDaniela oversaw safety and policy at   
OL,17,FOpenAI, one of the most talked-about AI
OL,18,Fcompanies in the world.                
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
