OL,3,ASimon Jack: Can Anthropic's            
OL,4,Arecord-breaking IPO stop the AI bubble 
OL,5,Abursting?                              
OL,7,FBut Daniela and her brother Dario - who
OL,8,Fworked there too - had misgivings over 
OL,9,Fsafety levels at OpenAI and thought it 
OL,10,Fcould be time to walk away.            
